var tipuesearch = {"pages":[{"title":" INCA ","text":"INCA This is the documentation for INCA (Intracule Calculator). This code parses .fchk , .wfx , and .bas files to perform highly efficient, OpenMP-parallelized evaluations of electron intracules using the Cioslowski-Liu algorithm and Salvador's TFVC partitioning scheme. Quick Navigation Go to the Modules tab at the top to see the data structures and grid generators. Go to the Source Files tab to see the raw code. Go to the User Manual tab for instructions on running the program and input keywords. Developer Info Markel Ylla","tags":"home","url":"index.html"},{"title":"gen_oh – INCA","text":"subroutine gen_oh(code, num, x, y, z, w, a, b, v) Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name integer :: code integer :: num double precision :: x (*) double precision :: y (*) double precision :: z (*) double precision :: w (*) double precision :: a double precision :: b double precision :: v","tags":"","url":"proc/gen_oh.html"},{"title":"LD0006 – INCA","text":"subroutine LD0006(X, Y, Z, W, N) Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name double precision :: X (6) double precision :: Y (6) double precision :: Z (6) double precision :: W (6) integer :: N Calls proc~~ld0006~~CallsGraph proc~ld0006 LD0006 gen_oh gen_oh proc~ld0006->gen_oh Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module.","tags":"","url":"proc/ld0006.html"},{"title":"LD0014 – INCA","text":"subroutine LD0014(X, Y, Z, W, N) Arguments Type Intent Optional At