s represent the following: Graph Key Module Module Submodule Submodule Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a submodule to the (sub)module which it is\ndescended from. Dashed arrows point from a module or program unit to \nmodules which it uses. Subroutines public  subroutine gridpoints (nradc, nAngc, sfalpha, nquad, cent, Ps) !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\nObtain radial nodes and weights (Gauss-Legendre)!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n!Obtain angular nodes and weights (Gauss-Lebedev)!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! !!!!!!!!!!!Compute grid points of quadrature!!!!!!!!!!!\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name integer, intent(in), dimension(nquad) :: nradc integer, intent(in), dimension(nquad) :: nAngc double precision, intent(in), dimension(nquad) :: sfalpha integer, intent(in) :: nquad double precision, dimension(3,nquad) :: cent double precision, intent(in), dimension(nquad) :: Ps public  subroutine gridpoints2 (nblock, tart, step, n_an_per_part) !Obtain angular nodes and weights (Gauss-Lebedev)!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! !!!!!!Compute grid points!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name integer, intent(in) :: nblock double precision, intent(in), dimension(2,nblock) :: tart double precision, intent(in), dimension(nblock) :: step integer, intent(in), dimension(nblock) :: n_an_per_part public  subroutine gridpoints3 (center_i, step_i, np_i) Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name